      "Section": "Live Viewer Count Analytics",
      "Anchor": "live-viewer-count-analytics",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Live Viewer Count Analytics API returns analytics data for the live viewer count of live videos. This API is designed to work for both scheduled live video events and spontaneous live events, similar to LMS APIs for video analytics. This API doesn\u2019t share member personal data as part of the API response.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Live Viewer Count Analytics",
      "Anchor": "live-viewer-count-analytics",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service currently provides a finder to get live viewer count analytics for a live video.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
